HB0217 Random hand count audits of election results.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lucas, Allemand, Bear, Brady,
Brown, G, Guggenmos, Heiner, Smith, S and Webb and
Senator(s) Pearson
AN ACT relating to elections; requiring a hand count audit of ballots as
specified; requiring rulemaking; and providing for an effective date.
